     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Lidia,<div><br></div><div>參考 <font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><b>as(items(rules), &quot;matrix&quot;)</b></font></div><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># title: transfer rule results to a matrix in arules package</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># date: 2014.7.5</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">library(arules)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># prepare data</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">a_list &lt;- list(</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I5&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I4&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I4&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;,&quot;I5&quot;),</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">  c(&quot;I1&quot;,&quot;I2&quot;,&quot;I3&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># set transaction names</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">names(a_list) &lt;- paste(&quot;T&quot;,c(1:9), sep = &quot;&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">a_list</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># force data into transactions</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">trans &lt;- as(a_list, &quot;transactions&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">trans</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># using apriori algorithm</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">rules &lt;- apriori(trans)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># transfer rules to matrix</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">rules.m &lt;- <font color=\"#ff0000\">as(items(rules), &quot;matrix&quot;)</font></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">rules.m</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"># end</font></div><span></span><span></span><br>Hsu Lidia於 2014年6月15日星期日UTC+8下午6時24分02秒寫道：<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">我用了arules套件，再使用apriori，以inspect()產出結果資料，想請問要如何將結果資料轉成matrix型式?謝謝!</div></blockquote></div></div>"
